item.description:
[STATUS_CHANGED] &lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;Microsoft has decided to not move forward with this feature.
&lt;p&gt;Just-in-time&lt;br&gt;
protection for SharePoint in Microsoft Purview DLP allows organizations to&lt;br&gt;
extend protection to unclassified files in SharePoint and apply restrictions&lt;br&gt;
defined in DLP policies at the time of egress. &lt; (GA: November CY2026) — Microsoft Purview

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Associates can trigger the &lt;strong&gt;Bulk add&lt;/strong&gt; operation from the button grid on the transaction screen in Store Commerce. A drawer-based dialog opens where associates can paste or enter multiple item number and quantity pairs, with one pair specified per line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supported format (GA: September CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Commerce
